*> Corrigé TP3.3 : programme de test de VALDATE
*> Compiler :  cob seance3/corriges/tp3_3.cob seance3/corriges/valdate.cob
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TP33.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TESTS-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 29022024.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 29022023.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 31042025.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 31122025.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 15132025.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(8) VALUE 01012000.
01 WS-TESTS REDEFINES WS-TESTS-DATA.
   05 WS-TEST-DATE PIC 9(8) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
01 WS-I            PIC 9.
01 WS-CODE         PIC 9.
   88 DATE-OK            VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 6
        CALL "VALDATE" USING WS-TEST-DATE(WS-I) WS-CODE
        IF DATE-OK
            DISPLAY WS-TEST-DATE(WS-I) " : OK"
        ELSE
            DISPLAY WS-TEST-DATE(WS-I) " : INVALIDE"
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.
